        "body": "### Key fob on chip ST17H66B with firmware \"KEY2\"\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed1fabe2-c315-4330-b319-a569ee8b15e7)\r\n\r\n[iSearching](https://pvvx.github.io/iSearching) - BLE, Flash\r\n\r\n[iSearching2](https://pvvx.github.io/iSearching2) - BLE, Flash\r\n\r\n[iSearching3](https://pvvx.github.io/iSearching3) - BLE, OTP (!)\r\n\r\nThere are a large number of [variations of this device](https://pvvx.github.io/iSearching/).\r\n\r\n## Switching to “FindMy” mode\r\n\r\n[FindMy](https://github.com/biemster/FindMy)\r\n\r\n* Run [PHY62x2BTHome.html](https://pvvx.github.io/THB2/web/PHY62x2BTHome.html)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39989a77-a187-46f4-85f6-8d3901782da6)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* To find a device in the connection list, press or hold the button on the key fob.\r\nSelect \"Connect\" and press the button on the key fob again.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* Set the \"FindMy\" key:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf89d834-3b4f-432f-bb1f-c1c980844ba8)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* Set the “FindMy” mode and the desired beacon transmission interval:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b068422f-5ea9-4d87-a24f-b934645c9240)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* Disconnect...\r\n",
