          "author": {
            "email": "f.fainelli@gmail.com",
            "name": "Florian Fainelli"
          },
          "message": "LICENSES: Import Broadcom BCM43xx license\n\nImport the license from:\n\nhttps://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/tree/LICENCE.broadcom_bcm43xx\n\ndescribing the redistribution rules for Broadcom proprietary\nfirmware(s).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florian Fainelli <f.fainelli@gmail.com>",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mj22226/source/commits/7c9bd18454ee8b18bfd3f191daf187970c731c43"
        },
        {
          "sha": "a34be08b632cb31fc0eacb26bde21c7bf613de69",
          "author": {
            "email": "f.fainelli@gmail.com",
            "name": "Florian Fainelli"
          },
          "message": "brcmfmac-sdio-firmware: Add Broadcom Bluetooth firmware/patch RAMs\n\nUtilize the LibreELEC brcmfmac_sdio_firmware repository to add support\nfor the Bluetooth firmware and patch RAM which are necessary for the\nBluetooth adapter to work reliably and operate with the proper MAC\naddress.\n\nPackages for the two most common BT adapters are created and more can be\nadded a long the way.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florian Fainelli <f.fainelli@gmail.com>",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mj22226/source/commits/a34be08b632cb31fc0eacb26bde21c7bf613de69"
        },
        {
          "sha": "50d3d065a68f825c4b9f66edc03310c474e3e548",
          "author": {
            "email": "f.fainelli@gmail.com",
            "name": "Florian Fainelli"
          },
          "message": "bcm27xx: Include brcmfmac-sdio-firmware-4345-bt for Pi4 profiles\n\nEnable brcmfmac-sdio-firmware-4345-bt by default to provide the\nappropriate Bluetooth firmware/patch RAM for the Bluetooth controller on\nPi4 and derivatives.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florian Fainelli <f.fainelli@gmail.com>",
          "distinct": true,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mj22226/source/commits/50d3d065a68f825c4b9f66edc03310c474e3e548"
